      <p>AmpintecPlus Co., Ltd. (安品特科技有限公司, "AmpintecPlus", "we", "us") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, process and use personal data through our website ampintecplus.com (the "Website"). It provides the notice required under Article 8 of Taiwan's Personal Data Protection Act ("PDPA") and, for users in the European Economic Area (EEA) or the United Kingdom, the information required under the EU General Data Protection Regulation ("GDPR") and the UK GDPR.</p>

