      <h2>8. Security</h2>
      <p>We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data, such as limiting access to our Google Sheets spreadsheet and mailbox to staff who need it, and using HTTPS encryption. However, no transmission over the internet is completely secure. If personal data is stolen, leaked, altered or otherwise compromised, we will notify you in an appropriate manner as required by law after investigation.</p>

      <h2>9. Minors</h2>
